    <h2>FAQ<span class="accent">.</span></h2>

    <details><summary>What is the answer to Brain Puzzle 3 Level 111?</summary><p>In order: 1) Swipe the hair under the bed to the right; 2) Drag the clock to the girl under the bed; 3) Drag the clock to the girl who's working out; 4) Swipe the quilt downwards; 5) Drag the clock to the sleeping girl; 6) Drag the clock to the girl reading a horror novel; 7) Drag the clock to the girl who is playing with her phone; 8) Drag the clock to the girl who is studying; 9) Drag the hammer to the crack; 10) Drag the clock to the girl who is digging a tunnel; 11) Swipe left on the door; 12) Drag the clock to the fashionable girl</p></details>
    <details><summary>Why does nothing happen when I tap in Level 111?</summary><p>Because nothing on this screen answers a plain tap: all 12 moves are 9 drags, 3 swipes. Hold, then drag or swipe exactly as the step card says. In Brain Puzzle 3 a drag that starts on the wrong prop simply snaps back, which looks like a tap doing nothing.</p></details>
